info = "[center]
First draft i made when i was thinking of how the battle scene should look like, originally inspired by two games, one being a mobile game called Life in Adventure and the other being Pokémon.
So i basically used how Life in Adventure station the characters on screen and how it had the HP above. Pokémon inspired me on how the bottom UI is arranged for choosing to fight, flee or use items, if you played Pokémon Moon on the Nintendo 3Ds you would know what I'm talking about.
Life in Adventure is an auto based combat while Pokémon is not. Mine is not auto based so you can guess how i eventually came by this draft. 
[/center]"
